diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..5be6c6a
--- /dev/null
+++ b/README.md
@@ -0,0 +1,30 @@
+# Pong
+
+This is a small Pong game implemented with only the Python 3 standard library.
+The game rules are kept separate from the terminal interface so they can be
+tested without curses.
+
+## Play
+
+From the repository root, run:
+
+```sh
+python3 -m pong
+```
+
+Controls:
+
+- `w` / `s`: move the left paddle up / down
+- Up / Down arrows: move the right paddle
+- `q`: quit
+
+The first player to reach five points wins.
+
+## Test
+
+Run the unit tests and Python syntax check with:
+
+```sh
+python3 -m unittest discover -s tests -q
+python3 -m py_compile pong/*.py
+```
